mntga.ach.scheelite_mined.title=Wu!
mntga.ach.scheelite_mined.desc=Your first scheelite ore. It will not smelt into anything. Go crush it.

mntga.ach.scheelite_acid.title=Can I Drink This?
mntga.ach.scheelite_acid.desc=Tungstic acid. A yellow filter cake, and a terrible beverage.

mntga.ach.beryllium_conc.title=A Buried Story
mntga.ach.beryllium_conc.desc=You pulled a beryllium concentrate out of the leach residue. Beryllium is rarer than tungsten.

mntga.ach.arsenic_cake.title=Do Not Lick
mntga.ach.arsenic_cake.desc=Arsenic trioxide, white arsenic. Wash your hands afterwards.

mntga.ach.arsenic_nugget.title=Bought With Blood
mntga.ach.arsenic_nugget.desc=Reduced white arsenic down to arsenic nuggets. Arsenic bronze and gallium arsenide are waiting.

mntga.ach.nothing_smelt.title=Rolling Log?
mntga.ach.nothing_smelt.desc=You put scheelite in a furnace. The furnace finished smelting it and handed you nothing at all.

mntga.ach.waste_acid.title=I Should Soak The World In Acid
mntga.ach.waste_acid.desc=Sixteen tungsten acid cakes, roughly ten thousand millibuckets of waste acid. Do not drink it.

mntga.ach.scheelite_300.title=That Is All Of It
mntga.ach.scheelite_300.desc=Three hundred scheelite blocks mined. About half a large vein.

mntga.ach.tungsten_carbide.title=High Strength Tungsten Carbide
mntga.ach.tungsten_carbide.desc=A tungsten carbide ingot. Second highest melting point, hardest thing around.

mntga.ach.seawater.title=That Is Not Water
mntga.ach.seawater.desc=The environmental pump pulled up seawater. It picks its output by biome, not by what is under it.

mntga.ach.chlorine.title=Both Will Kill You
mntga.ach.chlorine.desc=Electrolysed chlorine. Lye comes out the other side. Neither is safe to touch.

mntga.ach.lithium.title=It Starts With Lithium
mntga.ach.lithium.desc=Lithium powder from ore liquor. Batteries, grease and tritium breeding all start here.

mntga.ach.zinc.title=My Heart Is In Pieces!
mntga.ach.zinc.desc=After the sinter crumbles, the zinc stays behind as oxide in that pile of ash.

mntga.ach.hover.title=I Can Fly
mntga.ach.hover.desc=You lifted off with the powered hover pack. It will not hold you forever - the power runs out.

mntga.ach.escape_abyss.title=Escape The Abyss
mntga.ach.escape_abyss.desc=Nicotine poisoning. You ascended, or at least skipped the death screen.
